          <div class="w-9 h-9 flex-shrink-0 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl">1</div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-1">
            <div class="font-semibold text-xl tracking-tight">Submit Your Offer</div>
            <div class="text-slate-600 mt-1.5">Use the secure form below or email us directly. Include your intended use and best offer. All serious inquiries receive a personal response.</div>
